随机；背景GDMT按指南维持稳定","quote_sha256":"e6b14ac83200c45a655f0ddd62d977b3c4964ac50e58cdfb97023bc815de16be","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","span_id":"ES-03"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂平行对照：安慰剂片外观与SGC-R1L3一致，口服每日一次×12周","quote_sha256":"118772530a3eab0c5c8b4d5b6bf829b010e6cc626cf698254bbe46823e723f3e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","span_id":"ES-06"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:revision:4","quote":"已接受稳定GDMT（含ACEI/ARB/ARNI、β受体阻滞剂，有指征者MRA）至少4周仍保留症状的成人受试者","quote_sha256":"b0e328205d9f361a5ba8f48373081c4d4faaf80fcef053a9f14133c17c9f2697","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","span_id":"ES-07"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ES-01","ES-02","ES-03","ES-06","ES-07"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理确认是否在本章节引用独立剂量递增章节或在本章节内展开具体阈值","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-6-01","missing_source_classes":["剂量递增与安全性暂停规则专项文件"],"target":"剂量递增与安全性暂停规则的具体触发条件、暂停后恢复标准及永久停药标准"}],"heading":"研究治疗/干预","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，旨在评价SMOKE-r1-3口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R1L3）在慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低，HFrEF）成人受试者中的疗效与安全性。受试者经筛选合格后，按1:1:1:1的比例随机分配至SGC-R1L3低剂量组（2.5mg）、中剂量组（5mg）、高剂量组（10mg）或安慰剂对照组，共四个平行组。各组均口服给药，每日一次，连续治疗12周。安慰剂片外观与SGC-R1L3薄膜衣片一致，以维持双盲状态。所有受试者在研究期间须维持其原有的指南导向药物治疗（GDMT，包括ACEI/ARB/ARNI、β受体阻滞剂及有指征时的MRA）不变，不得自行调整背景用药剂量或种类。治疗期自第1天（基线随机访视）起至第12周止；治疗结束后进入末次给药后28天的安全性随访期。剂量递增与安全性暂停规则按方案剂量递增章节执行。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的总体研究设计、试验组与对照组设置、给药方案、安慰剂描述、背景GDMT要求及研究时期划分撰写。剂量递增与安全性暂停规则的具体阈值和操作流程需医学经理确认是否在本章节展开或引用独立章节。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3ea77adeef20_6d42524c90ea6325","section_number":"6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd366252ab32506ea0221368","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261002202558_9902d74d","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:revision:4","quote":"SMOKE-r1-3口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R1L3）：SGC-R1L3片 2.5mg/5mg/10mg（剂量组按随机分配），口服每日一次×12周","quote_sha256":"23e799700e1fd829f4539a09837f5986595d171a125bc1c08f97a2d248f300ce","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","span_id":"ES-04"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂平行对照：安慰剂片外观与SGC-R1L3一致，口服每日一次×12周","quote_sha256":"118772530a3eab0c5c8b4d5b6bf829b010e6cc626cf698254bbe46823e723f3e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","span_id":"ES-06"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ES-04","ES-06"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"由药学部门提供制剂处方及外观规格说明","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-6.1-01","missing_source_classes":["制剂处方与外观规格文件"],"target":"SGC-R1L3活性成分化学结构、辅料组成、规格对应的片剂外观描述细节"}],"heading":"试验用药品","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的试验用药品为SMOKE-r1-3口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R1L3），属小分子化合物，剂型为口服固体制剂（薄膜衣片），给药途径为口服，全身性暴露。SGC-R1L3设三个剂量规格：2.5mg、5mg和10mg，分别对应低剂量组、中剂量组和高剂量组，受试者按随机分配结果服用相应规格。给药方案为每日一次口服，连续给药12周。安慰剂对照组的试验用药品为安慰剂片，其外观（包括形状、颜色、大小及薄膜衣）与SGC-R1L3薄膜衣片一致，给药方案同为每日一次口服、连续12周，以维持双盲设计。所有受试者在治疗期间须同时维持其原有GDMT背景治疗不变。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的试验药物名称、技术类型（small_molecule）、剂型（口服固体制剂）、给药途径（口服）、暴露范围（systemic）、三个剂量规格（2.5mg/5mg/10mg）、给药频率（每日一次）、治疗周期（12周）及安慰剂描述撰写。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3ea77adeef20_72e4d3cef967858d","section_number":"6.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd366252ab32506ea0221368","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261002202558_9902d74d","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:revision:4","quote":"SMOKE-r1-3口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R1L3）：SGC-R1L3片 2.5mg/5mg/10mg（剂量组按随机分配），口服每日一次×12周","quote_sha256":"23e799700e1fd829f4539a09837f5986595d171a125bc1c08f97a2d248f300ce","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","span_id":"ES-04"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ES-04"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学部门提供研究者手册（IB）或等效非临床与既往临床资料汇编","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-6.1.1-01","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","非临床药理学与毒理学研究报告","既往人体临床研究数据"],"target":"SGC-R1L3完整作用机制描述、受体选择性、非临床GLP毒理学数据（含安全药理学）、既往I期/II期人体研究结果"},{"action":"由医学经理确认是否在本章节引用独立剂量递增章节或在本章节内展开具体阈值","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-6.1.1-02","missing_source_classes":["剂量递增与安全性暂停规则专项文件"],"target":"剂量递增与安全性暂停规则的具体触发阈值、暂停后恢复条件及永久停药标准"}],"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","非临床药理学与毒理学研究报告","既往人体临床研究数据"],"proposal_text":"SMOKE-r1-3口服sGC激动剂（SGC-R1L3）为小分子可溶性鸟苷酸环化酶（sGC）激动剂，通过激活sGC促进环磷酸鸟苷（cGMP）生成，发挥血管舒张及抗纤维化作用，拟用于慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低，HFrEF）成人受试者的治疗。本研究设SGC-R1L3低剂量（2.5mg）、中剂量（5mg）和高剂量（10mg）三个剂量组，口服每日一次，连续给药12周，以安慰剂片为平行对照。剂量递增与安全性暂停规则按方案剂量递增章节执行。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的药物名称、技术类型（small_molecule）、作用机制类别（sGC激动剂）、适应症（HFrEF）、三个剂量规格、给药频率及治疗周期撰写。sGC激动剂的一般药理学描述为机制类别的概括性表述，具体作用通路细节、非临床毒理学数据及既往人体研究结果未在本次允许来源中提供，需补充研究者手册（IB）后方可展开。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3ea77adeef20_a446dcfe892fe27f","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd366252ab32506ea0221368","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261002202558_9902d74d","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"由药学部门提供制剂工艺文件、包装规格说明及稳定性数据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-6.1.2-01","missing_source_classes":["制剂工艺与质量标准文件","包装与标签设计文件","稳定性与储存条件数据"],"target":"SGC-R1L3及安慰剂的制备工艺、质量标准、包装规格（如铝塑泡罩/瓶装）、标签内容、储存温度与湿度条件、有效期"},{"action":"由运营部门提供药物管理操作规程（SOP）或等效文件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-6.1.2-02","missing_source_classes":["药物管理与发放回收操作规程"],"target":"中心药房与研究中心的药物发放、回收、计数与销毁管理流程，药物 accountability 记录方式"},{"action":"由医学部门确认是否在本章节描述或引用安全性章节","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"GAP-6.1.2-03","missing_source_classes":["给药错误与药物过量处理规程"],"target":"给药错误与药物过量的定义、记录方式及报告流程"}],"heading":"制备、包装、标签、储存与管理","missing_source_classes":["试验用药品制备工艺与质量标准文件","包装规格与标签设计文件","储存条件与稳定性数据","药物管理与发放回收操作规程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要描述试验用药品（SGC-R1L3薄膜衣片及安慰剂片）的制备工艺、包装规格与形式、标签内容、储存条件（温度、湿度、光照）、有效期、运输要求、中心药房与研究中心的发放与回收管理流程、药物 accountability 记录方式以及给药错误与药物过量的记录要求。本次允许来源中未包含任何关于上述内容的具体项目文件，无法形成有实质信息的正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3ea77adeef20_a9cfbf06c91711a3","section_number":"6.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:cd366252ab32506ea0221368","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"e205b6ed5d4b0c87db3006e071bb270f9e1869d8e1b165cd1a1f94cf49d3eb47","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_3ea77adeef20_fe65ac8ebe5656d4:full-draft:cd366252ab32506ea0221368","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:cd366252ab32506ea0221368","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:f7cad6dd41a53dd961c595f921f126425c5cf6efe0ee27d189f890cb1954cb56:cd366252ab32506ea0221368","text_sha256":"e205b6ed5d4b0c87db3006e071bb270f9e1869d8e1b165cd1a1f94cf49d3eb47"},{"content_sha256":"db9b92d12e178aa2ca2e7a7f27910eba0a468cd52f76daba8dc1e7f0b82160dc","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","text_sha256":"db9b92d12e178aa2ca2e7a7f27910eba0a468cd52f76daba8dc1e7f0b82160dc"},{"content_sha256":"33118fc6958419e645c6a0a19471c78f80e0c4c28be03b46f2b3e61d287e030